SUMMARY:NASA Artemis III Astronaut Announcement Watch Party
DESCRIPTION:NASA plans to announce the four astronauts who will fly on the next launch for the Artemis program. Join us in the SECU Daily Planet Theater located in the Nature Research Center on Tuesday\, June 9\, at 11:00 AM to watch the livestream of the astronaut introductions and update on the Artemis program. Following on the success of the Artemis II mission\, Artemis III will travel to low Earth orbit in 2027 to test and demonstrate technologies to safely connect the Orion spacecraft with commercial lunar landing systems.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/nasa-artemis-iii-astronaut-announcement-watch-party/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages,General Events,SECU Daily Planet Theater,Walk-up Programs
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Smith":MAILTO:christopher.smith@naturalsciences.org
