SUMMARY:Paper Tube Frogs
DESCRIPTION:Frogs are amazing creatures!  Learn about frog anatomy before making your own frogs that can jump or catch flies in this interactive virtual program. \nThis program is for kids ages 5-13 in the ecoEXPLORE program\, but all are welcome! You will learn about ecoEXPLORE during the program. \nRegister
