SUMMARY:Birdwatching for Beginners
DESCRIPTION:Want to try birdwatching but aren’t sure how to get started? Join us for a laid-back programfor ages 8+ where you’ll learn the basics of identifying common birds! We will slowly walk about a mile to look for birds in different areas. We will learn about collaborative science projects to which we can contribute our birdwatching data. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/birdwatching-for-beginners-8/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
