SUMMARY:Playdate with Nature (Whiteville)
DESCRIPTION:Come learn and play outside in our outdoor spaces! Children can enjoy a guided interactive activity aimed to get them outside and connected with nature. Make sure to dress for the weather. No registration required \nFor the summer months (June\, July and August)\, this program is offered weekly on Saturdays from 11:30am–noon. \nNote: Playdates will take place in light rain or sunshine\, through chilly or warm weather. In the event of more extreme weather\, call the Museum at Whiteville or check our social media pages for updates on the program’s status. \nFor more information\, please call the Museum at Whiteville: 910.788.5100.
